message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AgnosticFL: one federated-learning hub across NVFlare, vantage6 and Flower"
abstract: >-
  A framework-agnostic federated-learning hub. Hospitals keep their own framework
  (NVFlare, vantage6 or Flower) and its standard client; one hub trains a single model
  across all of them with FedAvg or five other server aggregators. Per framework, a
  server-side adapter speaks one framework-free protocol to the hub's orchestrator.
type: software
